  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Regional network of community-based media outlets</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Asociacin Sobrevivencia Cultural (ASC) will strengthen a nascent network of about 10 community-based media organizations from Guatemala Nicaragua Panama Belize Costa Rica and El Salvador. These organizations include community radio stations and associations as well as outlets using interactive internet and social media. It will coordinate and provide training sessions and events to promote best practices such as how to follow local and international laws that regulate the operation of community-based media. These activities will contribute to a regional strategy to overcome current and future challenges for community-based media. Grant activities will benefit approximately 65 people directly and 650 indirectly.</narrative>
  </description>
